{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20334","headline":"卧疾 · 张籍","name":"卧疾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身病多思虑，亦读神农经。\n空堂留灯烛，四壁青荧荧。\n羁旅随人欢，贫贱还自轻。\n今来问良医，乃知病所生。\n僮仆各忧愁，杵臼无停声。\n见我形顦顇，劝药语丁宁。\n春雨枕席冷，窗前新禽鸣。\n开门起无力，遥爱鸡犬行。\n服药察耳目，渐如醉者醒。\n顾非达性命，犹爲忧患生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}